## Interface: 120105, 16001
## Title: QuestCompleteSound
## Notes: Hear your quest progress: a worker voice line when you complete a quest objective, and another when the whole quest is done (Horde Peon or Alliance worker). Sounds only. Options window via the addon compartment or /qcs config. Works in Retail and WoW Forever.
